  "project_description": "What is Double Field? \n Double Field is a small module written to provide extensions to Drupal's core Fields. By this module you can split your fields up into two separate parts.\n\n For the moment it includes the following sub-field types:\n\n \n Boolean \n Text \n Text (long) \n Integer \n Float \n Decimal \n Email \n Telephone \n Date \n Url \n \n Screenshots (Drupal 7) \n \n Conference \n Contextual information \n FAQ \n Social profiles \n IDE \n Links \n Our team \n Properties \n Tip of the day \n Units \n \n Note \n Please, do not post issues about «Triple Field», «Quadruple Field», «Quintuplet Field» and so on. This module is named «Double Field» and that's just what it'll do.\n\n Use drush generate field command to generate a field type with unlimited number of sub-fields.\n\n Back to top",
